WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:02.200
I'm Aracelis Girmay,

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:08.870
and this is, "For Estefani, Third
Grade, Who Made Me a Card."

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:16.000
Elephant on an orange line, 
underneath a yellow circle, meaning sun.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:22.930
Six green, vertical lines, with color
all from the top, meaning flowers.

00:00:22.930 --> 00:00:27.295
The first time I peel back the 
five squares of Scotch tape,

00:00:27.295 --> 00:00:31.945
unfold the crooked-crease 
fold of art class paper.

00:00:31.945 --> 00:00:36.306
I am in my living room.
It is June.

00:00:36.306 --> 00:00:39.959
Inside of the card, 
there is one long word, and then

00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:42.780
Estefani’s name:

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:46.730
Loisfoeribari Estefani

00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:48.702
Loisfoeribari?

00:00:48.702 --> 00:00:50.062
Loisfoeribari:

00:00:50.062 --> 00:00:55.242
The scientific, 
Latinate way of saying hibiscus.

00:00:55.242 --> 00:00:59.082
Loisforeribari: A direction, as in:
are you going

00:00:59.082 --> 00:01:03.402
North? South? East?
West? Loisfoeribari?

00:01:03.402 --> 00:01:07.672
I try, over and over, to read 
the word out loud.

00:01:07.676 --> 00:01:10.052
Loisfoeribari.

00:01:10.052 --> 00:01:12.112
LoISFOeribari.

00:01:12.112 --> 00:01:13.962
LoiSFOEribari.

00:01:13.962 --> 00:01:16.002
LoisFOERibARI.

00:01:16.002 --> 00:01:19.772
What is this word?
I imagine using it in sentences like,

00:01:19.772 --> 00:01:23.662
“Man, I have to go back to the house,
I forgot my Loisfoeribari.”

00:01:23.662 --> 00:01:27.772
or “There’s nothing 
better than rain, hot rain,

00:01:27.772 --> 00:01:33.052
open windows with music,
and a tall glass of Loisfoeribari.”

00:01:33.052 --> 00:01:38.632
or “How are we getting to Pittsburgh?
Should we drive or take the Loisfoeribari?”

00:01:38.632 --> 00:01:43.552
I have lived four minutes with this word 
not knowing what it means.

00:01:43.552 --> 00:01:47.422
It is the end of the year.
I consider writing my student,

00:01:47.422 --> 00:01:51.072
Estefani, a letter that goes:

00:01:51.072 --> 00:01:54.307
To The BRILLIANT Estefani!

00:01:54.307 --> 00:01:57.187
Hola, querida, I hope that you are well.

00:01:57.187 --> 00:02:02.197
I’ve just opened the card that you made 
me, and it is beautiful.

00:02:02.197 --> 00:02:06.319
I really love the way you 
filled the sky with birds.

00:02:06.319 --> 00:02:09.679
I believe that you are chula,
chulita, and super fly!

00:02:09.679 --> 00:02:12.179
Yes, the card is beautiful.

00:02:12.179 --> 00:02:14.839
I only have one question for you.

00:02:14.839 --> 00:02:18.809
What does the word ‘Loisfoeribari’ mean?

00:02:18.809 --> 00:02:22.099
I try the word again.
Loisfoeribari.

00:02:22.099 --> 00:02:25.449
Loisfoeribari.
Loisfoeribari.

00:02:25.449 --> 00:02:28.049
I try the word in Spanish.

00:02:28.049 --> 00:02:29.429
Loisfoeribari

00:02:29.429 --> 00:02:31.069
Lo-ees-fo-eh-dee-bah-dee

00:02:31.069 --> 00:02:32.499
Lo-ees-fo-eh-dee-bah-dee

00:02:32.499 --> 00:02:34.489
and then, slowly,

00:02:34.489 --> 00:02:39.119
Lo is fo e ri bari

00:02:39.119 --> 00:02:41.909
Lo is fo eribari

00:02:41.909 --> 00:02:46.419
love is for everybody
love is for every every body love

00:02:46.419 --> 00:02:50.259
love love everybody love
everybody love love

00:02:50.259 --> 00:02:54.119
is love everybody
everybody is love

00:02:54.119 --> 00:02:56.679
love love for love
for everybody

00:02:56.679 --> 00:02:59.099
for love is everybody
love is for every

00:02:59.099 --> 00:03:02.859
love is for every body
love love love for body

00:03:02.859 --> 00:03:07.159
love body body is love
love is body every body is love

00:03:07.159 --> 00:03:10.969
is every love
for every love is love

00:03:10.969 --> 00:03:15.109
for love everybody love love
love love for everybody

00:03:15.109 --> 00:03:17.789
Love is for everybody.

